    "description": "AzMaps in a 402 x 874 window (iphone_island), as a phone shows it: the search bar and the chips on top of the map, the sheet from the bottom (peek, half, full). Pictures, in order: 1 first look, 2 the results of 'Stuttgart', 3 the place at the sheet's peek, 4 half, 5 full, 6 the way, 7 a chip's search, 8 dark.",
